      "kind": "the two great names of",
      "word": "Hiroshige",
      "note": "The two great landscape names of ukiyo-e, a generation apart. Hokusai’s Thirty-six Views of Mount Fuji made landscape a subject in its own right; Hiroshige’s Fifty-three Stations of the Tōkaidō made it weather."
