      "kind": "copied in Arles by",
      "word": "Japanese",
      "note": "Van Gogh collected Japanese prints in Paris by the hundred, hung them in his room, and said he wanted to see with a Japanese eye. The flat colour and high hard horizon of the Arles pictures are the result."
